{%- liquid
  if section.settings.device_frame != blank
    assign df_src = section.settings.device_frame | image_url: width: 600
  else
    assign df_src = 'dm-closed-start.jpg' | file_url
  endif
-%}
{% style %}
  #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} {
    padding-top: {{ section.settings.padding_top }}px;
    padding-bottom: {{ section.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
    background-color: {{ section.settings.color_background }};
  }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    #shopify-section-{{ section.id }} {
      padding-top: {{ section.settings.padding_top_mobile }}px;
      padding-bottom: {{ section.settings.padding_bottom_mobile }}px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}
<div class="wrap">
  {%- liquid
    assign charging_count = section.blocks.size | plus: 1
  -%}
  <section class="ch" id="charging"><p class="ch__num">02 · Start</p><h2>Charge it first</h2><p class="ch__lead">Give the battery a full charge before the first session. Two ways, both over USB-C. Each of the four dots is a quarter of the charge: all four lit means full, about 1.5 hours from empty.</p><div class="slider tslider" style="--n:{{ charging_count }}"><div class="slides">
    {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
      <figure class="slide ts" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">{{ forloop.index }}</span><b>{{ block.settings.step_title }}</b><p>{{ block.settings.step_body }}</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--img">
        {%- if block.settings.image != blank -%}
          {{- block.settings.image | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: block.settings.image.alt | default: '' -}}
        {%- else -%}
          <svg viewBox="0 0 400 300" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" style="width:100%;height:auto"><rect width="400" height="300" rx="16" fill="#f0ede8"/><path d="M160 100a40 40 0 1 1 80 0 40 40 0 0 1-80 0zm-40 80 60-60 40 40 40-40 60 60H120z" fill="#c8b89a"/></svg>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div></figure>
    {%- endfor -%}
    <figure class="slide ts"><figcaption class="ts__tx"><span class="st__n">{{ charging_count }}</span><b>Check the level</b><p>Diamond switched off? One click on the dial shows the charge on the screen.</p></figcaption><div class="ts__pic ts__pic--mac"><div class="dev"><img src="{{ df_src }}" alt=""><div class="lv" data-scene="level" role="img" aria-label="Check the level: the Diamond screen, animated"></div></div><span class="finger" aria-hidden="true"></span></div></figure>
  </div><button class="nav prev" aria-label="Previous">‹</button><button class="nav next" aria-label="Next">›</button></div><h3 id="charger">Which charger</h3><p class="h3lead">There is no wall charger in the box. Use the USB-C cable from the box with any USB-C wall charger rated 30 W or more, such as a phone fast charger or a laptop charger.</p><div class="cws"><div class="cws__c cws__c--on"><b>30 W or more</b><span>A full charge in about 1.5 hours.</span></div><div class="cws__c"><b>15–29 W</b><span>It charges, just more slowly.</span></div></div><h3>Reading the four dots</h3><div class="dotsanim"><span class="d"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><div><b>Charging</b><small>The dots fill one by one, a quarter each. All four lit: full.</small></div></div><ul class="dots4"><li><span class="d"><i class="lit"></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i></span><b>25 %</b><small>A quarter</small></li><li><span class="d"><i class="lit"></i><i class="lit"></i><i class=""></i><i class=""></i></span><b>50 %</b><small>Half</small></li><li><span class="d"><i class="lit"></i><i class="lit"></i><i class="lit"></i><i class=""></i></span><b>75 %</b><small>Three quarters</small></li><li><span class="d"><i class="lit"></i><i class="lit"></i><i class="lit"></i><i class="lit"></i></span><b>100 %</b><small>Full, about 1.5 h from empty</small></li></ul><h3 id="charge-while-smoking">Charge while you smoke</h3><div class="cwsx">
    {%- if section.settings.charge_while_smoking != blank -%}
      {{- section.settings.charge_while_smoking | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', alt: section.settings.charge_while_smoking.alt | default: 'Diamond on a hookah from the back, a USB-C cable plugged in under the four lit dots', width: section.settings.charge_while_smoking.width, height: section.settings.charge_while_smoking.height -}}
    {%- else -%}
      <svg viewBox="0 0 400 300" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" style="width:100%;height:auto"><rect width="400" height="300" rx="16" fill="#f0ede8"/><path d="M160 100a40 40 0 1 1 80 0 40 40 0 0 1-80 0zm-40 80 60-60 40 40 40-40 60 60H120z" fill="#c8b89a"/></svg>
    {%- endif -%}
    <div><p class="h3lead">Keep a 30 W USB-C supply plugged into the back and the session runs on. Whether the battery also charges depends on the heat.</p><div class="cws"><div class="cws__c cws__c--on"><b>255 °C (491 °F) or lower</b><span>The battery charges while you smoke.</span></div><div class="cws__c"><b>Above 255 °C (491 °F)</b><span>The cable keeps the session going, but the battery does not charge.</span></div></div><p class="h3lead"><b>After about three hours on the cable,</b> give the battery a rest: take it out for about 20 minutes to cool, then charge it on its own.</p></div>
  </div></section>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "DM: Charging",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Charge while smoking"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "charge_while_smoking",
      "label": "Charge while smoking image"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Device frame"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "device_frame",
      "label": "Diamond device frame image"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "color_background",
      "label": "Background",
      "default": "#faf8f4"
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Section padding"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_top",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 120,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Padding top (desktop)",
      "default": 0
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_bottom",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 120,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Padding bottom (desktop)",
      "default": 0
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_top_mobile",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 80,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Padding top (mobile)",
      "default": 0
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "padding_bottom_mobile",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 80,
      "step": 4,
      "unit": "px",
      "label": "Padding bottom (mobile)",
      "default": 0
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "charge_step",
      "name": "Charging Step",
      "settings": [
        {
          "type": "image_picker",
          "id": "image",
          "label": "Step image"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "step_title",
          "label": "Step title"
        },
        {
          "type": "textarea",
          "id": "step_body",
          "label": "Step description"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "DM: Charging"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
